{"id":"intuicio_n","lemma":"intuición","pos":"noun","rank":4742,"glosses":["intuition","intuitiveness"],"ipa":"/intwiˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"intuiciones"},"order":4742,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-intuici%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Confía en tu intuición.","en":"Trust your intuition.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/202032","words":[{"g":"to reassure","l":"confiar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Jamás subestimes la intuición de una mujer.","en":"Never underestimate a woman's intuition.","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to underestimate","l":"subestimar"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"woman"}]},{"text":"Ella tenía suficiente intuición para entender lo que él realmente quería decir.","en":"She had enough sense to understand what he really meant.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"sufficient, enough"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to understand"},null,null,{"g":"he"},{"g":"really"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to say"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"what, that which"]]}]}